{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24099","headline":"何处堪避暑 · 白居易","name":"何处堪避暑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处堪避暑，林间背日楼。\n何处好追凉，池上随风舟。\n日高饥始食，食竟饱还游。\n游罢睡一觉，觉来茶一瓯。\n眼明见青山，耳醒闻碧流。\n脱袜闲濯足，解巾快掻头。\n如此来几时，已过六七秋。\n从心至百骸，无一不自由。\n拙退是其分，荣耀非所求。\n虽被世间笑，终无身外忧。\n此语君莫怪，静思吾亦愁。\n如何三伏月，杨尹谪虔州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}